  abilityName: Good-for-nothing garbage.
  abilityDesc: 25 combo Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP, boosts own critical rate), 7 combo Thunder attack on single foe (boosts own
    critical rate), boosts own spark damage for 3 turns, boosts all elemental damage
    for 3 turns, boosts Atk relative to Def for 3 turns & adds probable 1 turn Atk,
    Def reduction infliction to attack for 3 turns
